    "Regenerate the files with ./regenerate.sh, then update this file by hand.",
    "`schema` records what `DESCRIBE SELECT * FROM read_parquet(...)` returns in",
    "DuckDB 1.5.4 with the spatial extension loaded, so the pure TypeScript",
    "detection tests need no Parquet reader.",
    "`logicalTypes` records what parquet_schema() prints for each element that",
    "carries one."
